,{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":1000406,"initDialog":100040601,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[10095],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Mengde_10004/Q1000406","priority":5,"questId":10004,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":100040601,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":680529498,"text":"ふぅ、やっと片付いたな！","nextNodeIds":[100040602]},{"nodeId":100040602,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10095,"speakerName":"モナ","textMapHash":1253824450,"text":"おばばは、終わったら三通目の手紙を開けるようにと言っていました。","nextNodeIds":[100040603]},{"nodeId":100040603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10095,"speakerName":"モナ","textMapHash":1598321074,"text":"ですが儀式は成功していません…開けるべきでしょうか？","nextNodeIds":[100040604]},{"nodeId":100040604,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3334591474,"text":"オイラ、おまえたち師弟の考え方が分かってきた気がするぞ。","nextNodeIds":[100040605]},{"nodeId":100040605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1433014890,"text":"「終わったら開けろ」って言われただけで、成功したかどうかは指定されてないだろ？だから、開けてもいいと思うぜ。","nextNodeIds":[100040606]},{"nodeId":100040606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10095,"speakerName":"モナ","textMapHash":2427591666,"text":"確かに。どうせ、おばばはろくなこと書いていない気がします。","nextNodeIds":[100040607]},{"nodeId":100040607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":16024,"speakerName":"バーべロス","textMapHash":1482473778,"text":"「この文章を読んでいるということは、確かに試したということだね。」","nextNodeIds":[100040608]},{"nodeId":100040608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":16024,"speakerName":"バーべロス","textMapHash":1181960850,"text":"「まさか、本当にあれを試すとは…ヒッヒッヒッヒッ！」","nextNodeIds":[100040609]},{"nodeId":100040609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10095,"speakerName":"モナ","textMapHash":1257268826,"text":"お——ば——ば——！","nextNodeIds":[100040610]},{"nodeId":100040610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":16024,"speakerName":"バーべロス","textMapHash":2351940426,"text":"「カーンルイアには星海の湖が多数存在していて、空間的に不安定なところがある。だから、物理的ではない方法で天蓋バリアを貫通するほうが、成功しやすいんだよ。」","nextNodeIds":[100040611]},{"nodeId":100040611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":16024,"speakerName":"バーべロス","textMapHash":2117710506,"text":"「それに、あそこは秘匿性が高く、人跡まれな地下に位置している。仮に失敗しても、周囲への被害が比較的少なくて済む。」","nextNodeIds":[100040612]},{"nodeId":100040612,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":16024,"speakerName":"バーべロス","textMapHash":2243289250,"text":"「わしの弟子であるおまえなら、偽りの空の外をさまようアビスの魔物にも、きっと対処できると信じている。」","nextNodeIds":[100040613]},{"nodeId":100040613,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":16024,"speakerName":"バーべロス","textMapHash":3744299498,"text":"「勝てなくとも、逃げ切ることはできるだろう。おまえの逃げ足の速さは、なかなかのものだ。」","nextNodeIds":[100040614]},{"nodeId":100040614,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":16024,"speakerName":"バーべロス","textMapHash":2594976090,"text":"「あぁ、我ながら天才的だ。水占の術は雰囲気の面で、『渇』を癒す知恵とぴったり対応している。」","nextNodeIds":[100040615]},{"nodeId":100040615,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":16024,"speakerName":"バーべロス","textMapHash":2384513786,"text":"「実際の運用では、水占の盤も偽りの空の乱れを抑えてくれた。アリスは一体どうやってわしに勝つつもりなのか、本当に分からん——」","nextNodeIds":[100040616]},{"nodeId":100040616,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":2828504850,"text":"モナに続きは見なくていいと言われた。残りの数千字はおばばの自慢話だから、と。\\n観測結果を整理した後、みんなはモンドに戻った。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1000406,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[20300,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","1798"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_LOCK_POINT"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["1000401","1"],"PA